{%- comment -%}
  Payment methods row under the buy button: quantity-breaker, bundle-builder
  and reactive-variant-selector. Shopify's own full-colour icons, in the order
  of the old greyscale image (assets/payment-badge.svg) with Klarna in Amazon
  Pay's place. A fixed list, not shop.enabled_payment_types: that one changes
  with the shopper's market (Bancontact, EPS and the like). Shoppers in the
  US get no PayPal and no Klarna: the US checkout doesn't offer them.
  Styles: .mgx-pay-icons in magyx-brand.css.

  Usage:
  {% render 'mgx-payment-icons' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if localization.country.iso_code == 'US'
    assign mgx_pay_types = 'visa,master,american_express,diners_club,discover,google_pay,apple_pay' | split: ','
  else
    assign mgx_pay_types = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,diners_club,discover,google_pay,apple_pay,klarna' | split: ','
  endif
-%}
<ul class="mgx-pay-icons" role="list" aria-label="Payment methods">
  {%- for type in mgx_pay_types -%}
    <li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'mgx-pay-icons__icon' }}</li>
  {%- endfor -%}
</ul>
